# Range Rover L322, 2002-2012.
#
# The third-generation Range Rover: 4,950 mm long, 1,957 mm wide, 1,902 mm high,
# 2,880 mm wheelbase; BMW-derived 4.4 V8 then Jaguar 4.4/5.0, and diesels.
# Facelift 2009. The largest class-4 non-saloon parc of the 2000s.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Range_Rover#Third_generation_(2002)
#
# Colours: Java Black, Buckingham Blue, Zermatt Silver and Tonga Green are period
# Range Rover finishes.
#
# Weight: 45 in total (black 15, silver 12, blue 10, green 8), above the P38 as
# the L322 parc grew through the 2000s.
#
# Speed 210 km/h; comfort 150/405 (line). Classes 2,3,4.
# Dates: 2002-2012 with a road tail to about 2020.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/range-rover-l322.blend. References:
# citycars/references/range-rover-l322/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia Commons.

obj=citycar
name=RangeRoverL322(JavaBlack)
copyright=JamesPetts

DistributionWeight=15
intro_year=2002
intro_month=3
retire_year=2020
retire_month=6
speed=210
class=3,4
maximum_comfortable_journey_minutes=150
maximum_tolerable_journey_minutes=405

